        <li>Problem statement & user pain framing</li>
        <li>Goals, non-goals & success metrics</li>
        <li>User stories with acceptance criteria</li>
        <li>Technical constraints & dependencies</li>
        <li>Launch checklist & rollout plan</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rcard-footer">
        <a href="#" class="dl-btn">
          Download Free
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 2v9M4 7l4 5 4-5"/><line x1="2" y1="14" x2="14" y2="14"/></svg>
        </a>
        <span class="free-tag">Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Product Roadmap Template -->
    <div class="rcard" data-cat="pm">
      <div class="rcard-top">
        <span class="cat-badge cat-pm">PM Templates</span>
        <span class="format-badge">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="12" height="12" rx="1"/><line x1="2" y1="6" x2="14" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
          Google Sheets
        </span>
      </div>
      <span class="rcard-icon">🗺️</span>
      <h3 class="rcard-title">Product Roadmap Template</h3>
      <p class="rcard-desc">A quarterly roadmap tracker for teams managing multiple features and initiatives. Supports both now-next-later and calendar views.</p>
      <div class="inside-label">What's inside</div>
      <ul class="inside-list">
        <li>Quarterly initiative tracker</li>
        <li>Feature-level priority & status columns</li>
        <li>Dependencies & ownership mapping</li>
        <li>Progress dashboard with auto-calculations</li>
        <li>Stakeholder view (executive summary tab)</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rcard-footer">
        <a href="#" class="dl-btn">
          Download Free
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 2v9M4 7l4 5 4-5"/><line x1="2" y1="14" x2="14" y2="14"/></svg>
        </a>
        <span class="free-tag">Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Competitive Analysis Canvas -->
    <div class="rcard" data-cat="pm">
      <div class="rcard-top">
        <span class="cat-badge cat-pm">PM Templates</span>
        <span class="format-badge">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="12" height="12" rx="1"/><line x1="2" y1="6" x2="14" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
          Google Sheets
        </span>
      </div>
      <span class="rcard-icon">🔬</span>
      <h3 class="rcard-title">Competitive Analysis Canvas</h3>
      <p class="rcard-desc">The exact framework used to benchmark 40+ FP&A tools during the Oculon AI product build. Adapt it for any market.</p>
      <div class="inside-label">What's inside</div>
      <ul class="inside-list">
        <li>Feature-by-feature comparison matrix</li>
        <li>Pricing & positioning tracker</li>
        <li>Target ICP mapping per competitor</li>
        <li>Strengths & weaknesses summary</li>
        <li>White space opportunity identifier</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rcard-footer">
        <a href="#" class="dl-btn">
          Download Free
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 2v9M4 7l4 5 4-5"/><line x1="2" y1="14" x2="14" y2="14"/></svg>
        </a>
        <span class="free-tag">Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. User Story Map -->
    <div class="rcard" data-cat="pm">
      <div class="rcard-top">
        <span class="cat-badge cat-pm">PM Templates</span>
        <span class="format-badge">📝 Notion</span>
      </div>
      <span class="rcard-icon">🗂️</span>
      <h3 class="rcard-title">User Story Map Template</h3>
      <p class="rcard-desc">A JTBD-informed story map that helps teams visualise the full user journey before writing a single line of code.</p>
      <div class="inside-label">What's inside</div>
      <ul class="inside-list">
        <li>User activity → task → story hierarchy</li>
        <li>Persona & JTBD context columns</li>
        <li>Release slicing view (MVP vs V2)</li>
        <li>Story point & sprint tagging</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="rcard-footer">
        <a href="#" class="dl-btn">
          Download Free
